---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="bg-[#f9f9f9]">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-24 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center lg:py-[72px] relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="lg:mt-0 mt-8">The Tools You Need To Grow Repeat Sales</h2>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">Points, VIP, referrals, gift cards, and store credit work seamlessly together to create the ultimate rewards program for your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-16">
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Heartland gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-GC.svg" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Omnichannel: Physical and Digital Cards</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-base">99minds enables customers to purchase, send, and customize branded Gift Cards using Heartland Retail both in-store and online. Improve your retail experience with point-of-sale gift cards, providing a convenient and adaptable option for customer purchases.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
          
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Heartland loyalty program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-LP.svg" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-black">Robust and Flexible Loyalty Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-base">Introduce a comprehensive omni-channel loyalty program on Heartland to increase customer lifetime value and marketing efficacy. Utilize 99minds to boost your business's customer engagement by providing rewards and benefits both at the point of sale and online.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Heartland store credit" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-SC.svg" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-black">Store Credit- Convert Refunds Into Revenue</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-base">Provide store credit to your customers on Heartland, redeemable both in-store and online. This flexible option can be used for processing refunds or rewarding customers, enhancing their shopping experience.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Heartland referral program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-Rf.svg" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-black">Customisable Referral Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-base">Build a referral program that turns customer advocacy to revenue driver through SMS, emails, social media and more.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Heartland coupons" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-CG.svg" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-black">Wallet Passes and Push notification</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-base">Create stunning passes without any coding. Automatically update passes with new points, rewards, or offers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col  p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Heartland pos" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-POS.svg" loading="lazy">
              <h3 class=" text-2xl mt-8 text-black">Membership Programs</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-base">Showcase exclusive rewards and offers available only to members. These can be coupons, early access to sales, or special event invitations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
    </div>
  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto mt-16 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="https://giftcard.99minds.io/access/register" target="_blank" class="raise1 relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-black absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Install 99minds for free</span>
                </span>
          </a>
      </div>
</section>
